'''Marco''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Flower House}}. He asks for the player to pick {{Item|Poppy|amount=5}} and craft them into Rose Red Dye. In exchange, he gives the player a {{Item|Spray Can}} and access to the portal to the {{zone|Canvas Room}}.

